<title>USA: Fed says overnight system RPs totaled $7.222 bln.</title>
<headline>Fed says overnight system RPs totaled $7.222 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve added $7.222 billion to the banking system on Wednesday via overnight system repurchase agreements, the New York Fed confirmed.</p>
<p>(( --N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1867 ))</p>
